Here’s the exact API call you’d make to submit that vote:

```http
POST https://www.virustotal.com/api/v3/ip_addresses/22.242.75.136/vote
Authorization: key_four
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "vote",
  "attributes": {
    "verdict": "malicious"
  }
}
```

Just replace `key_four` with your actual API key (if it’s not already the literal value you’re using). This will register the IP address 22.242.75.136 as “malicious” in VirusTotal.
